  data: {
    LLM: 'Players bid a number and suit to establish trump. The winning bidder contributes that many trump cards to a shuffled bidding pile, others contribute the same count, and cards are redealt. Each player sets aside a target card, then twelve tricks are played with follow-suit rules and trump. Won cards score only when they form pairs, triples, or four-of-a-kinds.',
    Player: 'Players bid a number and suit to establish trump. The winning bidder contributes that many trump cards to a shuffled bidding pile, others contribute the same count, and cards are redealt. Each player sets aside a target card, then twelve tricks are played with follow-suit rules and trump. Won cards score only when they form pairs, triples, or four-of-a-kinds.',
    objective: 'Reach 250 points before the other players by winning scoring sets in tricks and matching the selected target card.',
    gameplay: 'Players bid a number and suit to establish trump. The winning bidder contributes that many trump cards to a shuffled bidding pile, others contribute the same count, and cards are redealt. Each player sets aside a target card, then twelve tricks are played with follow-suit rules and trump. Won cards score only when they form pairs, triples, or four-of-a-kinds.',
    keyRules: [
      'Four players use all 52 cards.',
      'Bidding chooses trump and creates a shuffled bidding pile.',
      'Each player sets one target card aside before play.',
      'Pairs, triples, and four-of-a-kinds in won tricks score toward 250.',
